7ec7f8f5 x4 T = x · (y ∘ x) = x ∘ y & x · (y · x) = (x · x) ∘ z & (x · y) · z = (z ∘ x) ∘ x
1. 2 laws of order <= 3 implied on the corpus; 2 proved by E; 0 emergent
    x · (x ∘ x) = x ∘ x
2. shadow T + (x·y = x∘y):
   => x·y=x              False
   => x·y=y              False
   => x·x=x              False
   => x·y=y·x            True
   => (x·y)·z=x·(y·z)    True
   => x·(x·y)=y          False
   => (x·y)·y=x          False
   => x·(y·z)=x·y        True
